course: dictionary
lesson: 13999
title: Lowermost
level: primary-4
stars: 0
explain: Lowermost is a long word, but you can break it into parts. Lower means further down, and the ending -most means the most. So lowermost means the very lowest, right at the bottom of a set of things. «The lowermost shelf holds the big books.» The big books sit on the very bottom shelf, under all the others.
explain: Lowermost is a formal word, the kind you find in writing more than in chatting. In everyday speech, people usually say bottom or lowest. You use it when there are several layers, levels or steps, and you want the one furthest down. «The lowermost layer of rock is the oldest» tells you the bottom layer is the first one to have formed.
explain: Its opposite is uppermost or topmost. If the lowermost step is the bottom one, the uppermost step is the top one. To check your meaning, swap in bottom or lowest. If the sentence still makes sense, you have got it right.
fact: Lowermost means lowest, at the very bottom of a set of things.
fact: Lowermost is a formal word. In everyday speech, people usually say bottom or lowest.
fact: «The lowermost shelf» means the bottom shelf.
fact: «The lowermost layer of rock is the oldest» means the bottom layer.
fact: The opposite of lowermost is uppermost or topmost.
exercise: «The lowermost shelf holds the big books.» What does lowermost mean here? | A shelf in the middle | *The very bottom shelf | The very top shelf | A shelf made of wood
exercise: Which word is the opposite of lowermost? | Lowest | Middle | *Uppermost | Closest
exercise: Find and copy the word that means the furthest down of several layers. | oldest | rock | *lowermost | layer
test: «The lowermost step of the ladder was broken.» What does lowermost mean? | *Lowest, at the very bottom | Missing from the ladder | Shiny and new | Highest and broken
test: Which word is the most formal way to say bottom? | Loud | *Lowermost | Sad | Quick
exam: Which sentence uses lowermost correctly? | Lowermost ran across the park. | The lowermost song was very loud. | The lowermost sky is full of stars. | *The lowermost drawer is full of socks.
